Subject: [PATCH] nss: own dynamic and Wi-Fi VDEV request lifetimes

Bind replies to immutable core/interface/family/type/cookie identities.
Keep client callbacks and context in the driver, revoke on timeout or
unregistration, and drain dispatched callbacks before private waits free.
Validate dynamic replies before changing the host allocator.

